Window semantics agree with CW-F04:
- leaving after the threshold (C21) is AUTO;
- an outside ping 1 s after the window end with a return and the last inside ping 30 s earlier (C04) cannot be LEFT and is AUTO;
- real departures of 90 s (C50) or at about 110 km/h (C51) are R4 at APPROVE, with LEFT_MIN_OUTSIDE_S or SPEED_MAX_KMH decisive.
